@* The terms, on every page. Any button with data-open-modal="terms-modal" opens it. *@
<dialog class="modal modal-terms" id="terms-modal" aria-labelledby="terms-title">
    <div class="modal-body">
        <h2 class="title" id="terms-title">Before you write</h2>

        <div class="modal-scroll">
            <h3 class="heading">Keep it to wishes</h3>
            <p class="body">Please don't put personal information in a letter: no full names, addresses, phone numbers, school names or photos of people. A nickname and a wish list are all Santa needs.</p>

            <h3 class="heading">Anyone with the link can read it</h3>
            <p class="body">There are no accounts. A letter is private only as long as its link is. Share it with people you trust.</p>

            <h3 class="heading">Letters can't be changed</h3>
            <p class="body">Once a letter is sent, it can't be edited or taken back.</p>

            <h3 class="heading">Letters stay for 90 days</h3>
            <p class="body">After 90 days, Astro carries the letter to the North Pole for good, and its link stops working.</p>
        </div>

        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-close-modal>Close</button>
    </div>
</dialog>
